  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Add salt and water to the saucepan, cover, and bring to a boil over high heat. Once boiling, stir in oats and maple syrup. Cover and let simmer, on low, 3-5 minutes, or until oats reach desired consistency."
    },
    {
      "text": "Wash and dry apples, then core and medium dice."
    },
    {
      "text": "Roughly chop peanuts."
    },
    {
      "text": "When oats are done, stir in peanut butter."
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, divide oats between bowls and top with chopped apples and peanuts. Enjoy!"
    }
